<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10IntervalSuborder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10IntervalSuborder}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}interval\\text{-}suborder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10IntervalSuborder}_S(I,P,R,a,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,R)\n\\land\na\\in P\n\\land\nb\\in P\n\\land\n\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nI=\n\\left\\{\nx\\in P:\n\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\n\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in R\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}interval\\text{-}suborder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10IntervalSuborder}_S(I,P,R,a,b)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,R)\n\\land\na\\in P\n\\land\nb\\in P\n\\land\n\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nI=\n\\left\\{\nx\\in P:\n\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\n\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in R\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient order is now an argument and is required to be a partial order; the closed interval is defined by exact pair-coded inequalities.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10IntervalSuborder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}interval\\text{-}suborder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10IntervalSuborder}_S(I,P,R,a,b)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,R)\n\\land\na\\in P\n\\land\nb\\in P\n\\land\n\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\nI=\n\\left\\{\nx\\in P:\n\\langle a,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\n\\langle x,b\\rangle\\in R\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1234,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2867","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-order10-interval-suborder.md|58-df-zfc-order10-interval-suborder]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}